blocks.en:
Table 1 : Procedural video datasets and their supervision for planning and generation. Sizes retain their original units: videos (vid.), segments (seg.), clips.
Tasks/Dom.: tasks/domains;
Step-Clip: temporally localized step annotations;
Atomic Act.: single-action granularity;
Coverage Target: annotation protocol targets all visible task-relevant steps, excluding background intervals, rather than a verified coverage rate;
Task Goal: explicit task-level goal;
Completion: explicit task-completion supervision.
Gen., Eval., and Recog. denote generation, evaluation, and recognition.

blocks.zh:
表1:用于规划和生成的程序录像数据集及其监督。 尺寸保留了原来的单位:视频(vid.),片段(如.),片段.
任务/办公室:任务/领域;
分步剪接:按时间定位的分步剪接说明;
原子法:单活性颗粒;
目标:说明协议针对所有与任务相关的明显步骤,不包括背景间隔,而不是经核实的覆盖率;
任务目标:明确的任务一级目标;
完成:明确任务完成监督.
Eval. 和Recog. Gen.表示生成、评价和认可。

blocks.en:
Plan Accuracy: determine whether each reference step’s
required sub-goal is visibly achieved, including by equivalent actions;
report 100 × ( achieved sub-goals / N ) 100\times(\text{achieved sub-goals}/N) .

blocks.zh:
计划准确性:确定每个参考步骤是否
明显地实现了所需的次级目标,包括采取同等行动;
报告 100 × (实现的分目标 / N ) 100\ times (\text{已实现的分目标 }/ N).
